  "baseline_commit": "501b1a0a80e77e47068450bd263993a28eab1b3e",
  "passed": [
    "After reversing reviewed selection-BGM changes, only authorized Tanko combat/progression/game-over, reward/notice/Trio/Tanko PNG changes differ; ordinary items, region healing and other gameplay/audio/assets are preserved; JS syntax passes.",
    "The original Math.random()<0.5 split is preserved at both boundaries: one 50/50 health/power draw per boss, with no extra no-reward branch.",
    "All 24 character×stage×reward cases defeat bosses through real bullets/collision: payout precedes original next-region +2 HP; desert final clear adds no region healing and no item is dropped.",
    "Health 4/6/9 and upgrade 5 caps hold; partially useful health rewards report +1 and full caps report 0 without rerolling the reward type.",
    "Ten attempts against the same defeated boss pay once; living bosses and ended games pay nothing; actual multi-bullet kills in the stage matrix also pay once.",
    "Ordinary special-enemy kills still drop one 13px health/power item; bonuses apply only on contact with the same effects and no boss notice or double pickup.",
    "The 1.8-second notice displays actual +2/+1/cap text, replaces earlier messages without stale timeouts, fits three landscape sizes and overlaps no HUD/touch/fullscreen/exit controls.",
    "Final-clear rewards remain visible in fullscreen selection; a new game clears old text and its new boss can pay again; no native dialogs or uncaught JS errors occur."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Actual headless Chromium with mobile touch emulation; physical Galaxy/Samsung Internet/Chrome and speaker/sensor testing remain outstanding.",
    "Controlled health, boss and random samples; actual shoot/collision/update paths are exercised, not a manual difficulty playthrough."
  ],
